                <td class="p-4 text-emerald-300">Zero fuel costs; off-grid thermal buffer overnight; shared micro-logistics pooling.</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-slate-400">Modular design tailored for batch micro-yields rather than mega-industrial scale.</td>
                <td class="p-4"><span class="bg-agri-500 text-slate-950 font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded shadow">Optimal Agrarian Fit</span></td>
