        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-solar-400 uppercase tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <i data-lucide="target" class="w-4 h-4"></i> The Identified Technological Gap
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
          While existing solutions offer either <em>high-capacity/high-cost central cooling</em> or <em>ultra-low-cost passive evaporation</em>, there is a distinct lack of a <strong>decentralized, modular, off-grid active refrigeration system</strong> that integrates <strong>thermal energy storage (TES)</strong> for night preservation without reliance on heavy lithium battery banks or expensive diesel transport.
        </p>
