    <section id="tab-invention" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i data-lucide="cpu" class="text-agri-500"></i> Part III: Invention Specification & Novelty
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Technical breakdown of AgriKonek-Solaris core components and architectural novelty.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Pillar Engineering Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        
        <!-- Pillar 1 -->
        <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-agri-500/20 border border-agri-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-agri-400">
            <i data-lucide="cpu" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-white">1. Dual-Stage Thermoelectric Core</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Eliminates traditional compressors, refrigerants, and mechanical wear. Uses solid-state Peltier semiconductors coupled with heat pipes and liquid cooling blocks to transfer heat out of the insulated chamber with high reliability.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>Zero chemical refrigerant emissions</li>
            <li>No moving compressor parts</li>
            <li>Solid-state vibration-free design</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 2 -->
        <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/20 border border-blue-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400">
            <i data-lucide="thermometer-snowflake" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-white">2. Salt-Hydrate PCM Battery</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            A specialized Phase Change Material (PCM) thermal battery surrounding the storage chamber. During peak sunlit hours, excess solar energy freezes the PCM salt-hydrate solution. Overnight, the solidifying PCM passively absorbs internal heat without battery draw.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>Phase change point calibrated at 5°C</li>
            <li>Stores cold thermal energy passively</li>
            <li>Reduces electrical battery requirements by 65%</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 3 -->
        <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-solar-500/20 border border-solar-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-solar-400">
            <i data-lucide="radio" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-white">3. Off-Grid LoRa Mesh Logistics</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Integrated ESP32 microcontroller with LoRa (Long Range) 433/915MHz radio links units across neighboring farms. Farmers broadcast available storage space and harvest transport readiness without internet or cellular reception.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>10km direct radio link line-of-sight</li>
            <li>Zero cellular data or internet fees</li>
            <li>Autonomous peer-to-peer load pooling</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Novelty Summary Box -->
      <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-xl border border-agri-500/30 bg-agri-950/20 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-agri-400 uppercase tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <i data-lucide="award" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Novelty Justification for STS Exam Criteria
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
          AgriKonek-Solaris goes beyond modifying existing products. It creates a novel system-level integration: merging <strong>solid-state physics (Peltier)</strong> with <strong>passive thermodynamic storage (PCM)</strong> and <strong>decentralized communication (LoRa Mesh)</strong> to address a socio-technical crisis in Philippine agriculture without high grid costs or fossil fuel consumption.
        </p>
      </div>

    </section>

